graph TD
    A[Leave Request] --> B[Validate Request]
    B -->|Invalid| ERR1[Return Error]
    B -->|Valid| C[Check Leave Balance]
    C -->|Insufficient| ERR2[Return Error]
    C -->|Sufficient| D[Create Request]
    D -->|Error| ERR3[Return Error]
    D -->|Success| E[Route to Manager]
    E -->|No Manager| ERR4[Escalate to HR]
    E -->|Manager Found| F[Manager Review]
    F -->|Approved| G[Update Status]
    F -->|Rejected| G
    G -->|Error| W1[Log Warning]
    G -->|Success| DONE[Request Complete]

    style ERR1 fill:#f96
    style ERR2 fill:#f96
    style ERR3 fill:#f96
    style ERR4 fill:#f96
    style W1 fill:#ff9
    style DONE fill:#9f9
